Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["01 Model Development", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9821913146818466`*^9, 3.9821913242147045`*^9}, {
  3.982192215691025*^9, 
  3.9821922192738476`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"70fc7f0d-3b96-5746-9f8b-\
a221eddd0345"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Introduction to ABM", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9822235914297104`*^9, 3.9822236476229877`*^9}, {
  3.982252930349556*^9, 
  3.982252932936325*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"4f7d4ddc-f7b1-774b-ac25-\
f1a152fa677a"],

Cell["\<\
Agent-Based Modeling simulations consist of agents that interact with each \
other and their environment through simple rules. As the simulation evolves \
through time,  each agent has its own state, such as position, energy, age, \
hunger, and other characteristics that constantly change. These rules produce \
interesting behaviors among the agents that can be studied, mimicking real \
life to create a realistic, albeit simplified, simulation.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9822530010870266`*^9, 3.982253006910301*^9}, 
   3.9822554213624916`*^9, {3.9822554691372585`*^9, 3.9822554691571045`*^9}, {
   3.9822555036656055`*^9, 
   3.982255620652092*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1dfb70c9-37f3-1943-94aa-\
14a8889170e4"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Current Scope", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9822268098682213`*^9, {3.9822268521701164`*^9, 
   3.982226853463169*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"015076e2-4beb-0741-a350-\
56a86a1d7b26"],

Cell["\<\
Currently, our model simulates the basic behaviors within a population, \
consisting of agents that move, search for and consume nearby food, and gain \
or lose energy. We\[CloseCurlyQuote]ve also created a visualization for our \
ABM so far.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982253020855629*^9, 3.982253031160576*^9}, {
  3.982255872361162*^9, 3.982256007212734*^9}, {3.982949042916792*^9, 
  3.982949052745554*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2f6dff15-ac40-5946-9765-\
dfadd688eaf0"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["02 Constructing the Helper Methods", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982192226940838*^9, 
  3.9821922324859447`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c5be0d16-ba53-2546-a6ff-\
79990cc6644d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["checkWithinRadius[p1_, p2_, r_]", "Subsection",
