368f58d44522"],

Cell["\<\
Checks whether two points are within a specified Euclidean distance. This is \
often used in conjunction with proximityRadius.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9822582353925304`*^9, 3.9822582975094585`*^9}, {
  3.9822585458305397`*^9, 
  3.982258546893841*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c246b5ea-91bf-094a-8994-\
10f8d1501980"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["checkFoodWithinRadius[agentPos_, foodPos_, proxRadius_]", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.982257840569044*^9, {3.9822578821392593`*^9, 
   3.9822578831081963`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"95fae602-ecc6-8f43-9322-\
aa59ea2f1237"],

Cell["\<\
Checks whether some food lies within an agent\[CloseCurlyQuote]s proximity \
radius.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9822583101318684`*^9, 3.982258328382492*^9}, {
  3.9822585340207386`*^9, 
  3.9822585372732353`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"484be3dc-b13f-0449-a401-\
5e32c480787d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
findNearestSensableFoodI[agent_, foodPositions_List, params_]\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9822578903984795`*^9, 
  3.9822578982893543`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"21e8154f-70be-b044-a9ff-\
35490d52acfc"],

Cell["\<\
Finds the closest food that is within an agent\[CloseCurlyQuote]s proximity \
radius. If a food item exists, the function returns its index; otherwise, it \
returns -1 to show that there is no food nearby.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982258341530279*^9, 3.982258388623953*^9}, {
  3.98225851664447*^9, 
  3.982258557088091*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7a26224a-0879-0740-9ed0-\
24b55c2c4781"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["createAgent[pos_, energy_, age_]", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9822579140424137`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"3eee4dc7-f9ac-9045-81be-\
029933c11ca7"],

Cell["\<\
Creates an agent as an association with a certain position, energy, and age. \
This allows us to maintain a consistent structure for all agents and allocate \
them in one place.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982258402012926*^9, 
  3.9822584493993206`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fe332b47-11e1-c74e-b85d-\
105b345ce2d4"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

