\>", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9822579277148094`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"70edffac-edce-f140-91d5-\
f2f0540b28d5"],

Cell["\<\
Updates a specific attribute of an agent within a list of agents, which is \
useful for testing and debugging.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982258471149784*^9, 
  3.9822584945678806`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"511c3be5-adbb-7d40-8f60-\
